menu "ePSKc Commissioner"

    config EPSKC_WIFI_SSID
        string "Wi-Fi SSID (compile-time default)"
        default ""
        help
            Applied only when no Wi-Fi credentials are stored on the device
            yet, so a unit provisioned over the console keeps its runtime
            credentials across reflashes. Leave empty to provision with the
            `wifi <ssid> <password>` console command instead.

    config EPSKC_WIFI_PASSWORD
        string "Wi-Fi password (compile-time default)"
        default ""
        help
            Password for EPSKC_WIFI_SSID. Stored in the firmware image in
            plain text - do not use on images you distribute.

endmenu
